    Add granularity to stage timing in Jenkins CI. I looked into making something like a 50% runtime increase a reason to fail CI, but realized that there are lots of caveats that make this a bad reason to fail CI. Maybe in a dedicated workstation this will be more reasonable. But I did realized that the timings needed to be more granular, so we do that here.

